Hi Cheryl,

There is a distance sampling google group, like this one, see here: https://groups.google.com/g/distance-sampling

It does depend on whether flocks are multi species or single species (there was a post on the DS group about this recently). Normally you’d measure to the centre of the flock and have flock-size as a covariate.

